{
  "out_dir": "apps/web/public/docs/trust-passport",
  "_hints": "/ai-trust loads two API calls; wait for '#what' / '#principles ul' before marking. The principle map loads separately from the rest. share-created CREATES a share link for patient1 (1 hour, Latest screening levels only). For share-public you need a real token: create a 1-hour share as patient1 (e.g. run share-created, or POST /api/v1/shares), read the full URL from input#share-url (the token is shown once), put the token in share-public's path in place of REPLACE_WITH_TOKEN, capture it SIGNED OUT (no account), then revoke that link in /reports (Revoke button) so it does not stay active. patient1 should have store_history ON and saved screenings; if the share page says history is hidden, use patient4. If share-public cannot be made, capture /share/invalid-link-example-000000000000000000000 instead (shows 'This link is not valid') and tell the writer.",
